IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAY0011.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY PAY0011C.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 UNION-DUES         PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM 3000-UNION-DUES
    DISPLAY "UNION-DUES=" UNION-DUES
    STOP RUN.
3000-UNION-DUES.
    IF UNION-FLG = 'Y'
        *> HIGHER UNION DUES
        IF GRS-PAY-AMT >= 4000
            MOVE 45 TO UNION-DUES
        ELSE
            MOVE 30 TO UNION-DUES
        END-IF
    ELSE
        MOVE 0 TO UNION-DUES
    END-IF.
